---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PrivateCatalogApp from "../components/PrivateCatalogApp";
---

<Base title="Private catalog">
  <h1>Private catalog viewer</h1>
  <p class="muted" style="max-width: 70ch">
    Enterprises run their own AgentDossier instance to scan internal networks for agents that publish ARD manifests,
    A2A agent cards or MCP servers. This page opens the catalog such an instance produces and searches it here, in the
    browser, with the same intent parser and explanations as the public demo. Nothing is uploaded.
  </p>
  <PrivateCatalogApp client:load />
  <h2>Produce a private catalog</h2>
  <pre class="card small"><code>uv sync --extra connectors
agentdossier build --sources seed,ard --ard-domains agents.example.internal \
  --net-policy enterprise --scope private --tenant "Example Corp" --out ./catalog
# then open ./catalog/index.json above, or serve ./catalog behind your SSO</code></pre>
  <p class="muted small">The self-hosted edition (Phase 2) adds the scheduled scanner, ARD REST API and OIDC login in one container.</p>
</Base>
